  "id": 1125,
  "description": "🦸‍♂️ LAZY HEROES — We Fight… Eventually\n\nLET’S SAVE THE WORLD — ONE NAP AT A TIME. 😴💥\n\nWelcome to LAZY HEROES a guild created for players who want to enjoy the game, not turn it into a full-time job.\nIf you’re here to chill, have fun, and play at your own pace… you’re exactly where you belong.\n\nThis is our official Guild Discord, created for easier communication, teamwork, and making new friends.\n\nhttps://discord.gg/6WBJaGYx- Join our discord\n\n⭐ Requirements\n\n✅ Join the guild\n✅ Play the game\n✅ Have fun\n\nThat’s it.\n\nActive players are always welcome, but how much you participate is totally up to you. We’re here to play, relax, and help each other when needed  no pressure, no stress.\n\n🧘 What We Promise\n\n❌ No kicking people for being inactive for 24 hours\n❌ No forcing you into events or specific activities\n✅ A friendly, drama-free place to chill\n\n⚔️ What We Don’t Promise\n\nIf you’re looking for hardcore ranking pushes, constant min-maxing, or top-tier competition… this probably isn’t the guild for you.\nWe’re not tryhards — we’re Lazy Heroes, after all.\n\n❤️ Who We’re Perfect For\n\nPlayers who:\n\n✅ Enjoy the game at their own pace\n✅ Like to help others (when they feel like it 😌)\n✅ Want a cozy, welcoming community\n✅ Appreciate a good sense of humor\n\nIf that sounds like you, then…\nWELCOME TO THE GUILD!\n\nLet’s save the world — one nap at a time. 😴💥",
